OL,3,AFive things you may not know about Emmy
OL,4,Ahistory-maker Matthew Rhys
OL,5,
OL,6,FHollywood actor Matthew Rhys has made
OL,7,Fhistory at the Emmys by becoming the
OL,8,Ffirst person to win two lead acting
OL,9,Fprizes in one night.
OL,11,FHe was named best lead actor in a
OL,12,Flimited series for the psychological
OL,13,Fthriller The Beast In Me, and best lead
OL,14,Factor in a comedy for his role in
OL,15,FWidow's Bay.
OL,17,FRhys told BBC Wales that receiving the
OL,18,Fdouble honour had been a "complete out
OL,19,Fof the body experience" which "still
OL,20,Ffeels as surreal as it was last night".
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
